<cl=A2A2A2>
It has long been known that Necromancers live among the swamps in the southwest of Phoebus. However, recently
time, they left their native places, and now they can be found in any corner of the Sphere.
The members of this guild are interested only in the mysteries of Death and, partly, Life, so of all
These magicians strenuously study only the Earth, and Air and Fire are forbidden in the guild.
Necromancers do not differ in strength, accuracy, or endurance, although they are quite dexterous.
Constantly training in the use and counteraction of magic, Necromancers have become dangerous opponents.
Naturally, for those who managed to get a significant title, the path to this guild of magicians is closed.
<br><tab>Necromancers did not spend years in isolation in vain, and their secret knowledge is a testimony
how they succeeded in their business. Using the Call of Death, they summon the souls of the dead,
who fight on their side; they can resurrect a dead hero or turn a weakened one
a man turned into a terrible zombie.
<br>
